Package: ostena-agent
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ostena project <maintainers@ostena.invalid>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd (>= 252), passwd
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Phdhebde/Ostena
Description: Ostena administration bastion, gateway agent
 Gateway agent of the Ostena administration bastion (PAM): opens the SSH,
 RDP and VNC sessions to the targets of its group and dials back to the
 core through a mutual TLS tunnel. It listens on no network port unless its
 native SSH server is configured.
 .
 The package installs the static ostena binary. "ostena agent setup" writes
 the configuration, enrols the agent and starts the hardened systemd
 service.
